<title>USA: Excel has no comment on shr activity - NYSE.</title>
<headline>Excel has no comment on shr activity - NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday Excel Communications Inc declined to comment on its unusual market activity.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it had requested Excel make a public statement that may explain the stock movement but the company said its policy is not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors.</p>
<p>Excel shares jumped 2-1/8 to 18-7/8 in afternoon trading.</p>
